02:18:57.139 --> 02:18:59.738
for me was whether or
not phthalates, and BPAs,

02:18:59.738 --> 02:19:01.280
and these things
present in plastics,

02:19:01.280 --> 02:19:03.469
and some people
claim in tap water,

02:19:03.469 --> 02:19:08.299
are bad for males after
they're born and after puberty.

02:19:08.299 --> 02:19:10.040
What are your thoughts on--

02:19:10.040 --> 02:19:12.049
or I should just ask you,
do you drink water out

02:19:12.049 --> 02:19:13.070
of plastic bottles?

02:19:13.070 --> 02:19:17.660
Do you avoid drinking out of
cans that are not specifically

02:19:17.660 --> 02:19:20.120
non-BPA containing cans?

02:19:20.120 --> 02:19:22.010
And do you actively
avoid phthalates?

02:19:22.010 --> 02:19:23.120
My understanding
is that phthalates

02:19:23.120 --> 02:19:25.250
are most enriched in
pesticides, and that's

02:19:25.250 --> 02:19:28.639
why you're seeing dramatic
drops in sperm and testosterone

02:19:28.639 --> 02:19:31.597
levels mainly in rural areas
where they're dust cropping.

02:19:31.597 --> 02:19:32.389
KYLE GILLETT: Yeah.

02:19:32.389 --> 02:19:35.990
So I do avoid drinking out
of cans that-- or plastics

02:19:35.990 --> 02:19:40.219
that may have BPA or
bisphenol A in them.

02:19:40.219 --> 02:19:43.910
Bisphenol A is known
to bind to what

02:19:43.910 --> 02:19:45.950
I would consider the
fifth estrogen receptor,

02:19:45.950 --> 02:19:49.250
estrogen-related receptor gamma.

02:19:49.250 --> 02:19:52.880
So it I would consider
it a xenoestrogen.

02:19:52.880 --> 02:19:55.638
So phytoestrogens are estrogens
from plants, and in general,

02:19:55.638 --> 02:19:57.680
they're not concerning or
clinically significant.

02:19:57.680 --> 02:20:01.020
And xenoestrogens are
just other estrogens.

02:20:01.020 --> 02:20:05.630
So I do avoid BPA and
I also test my water.

02:20:05.630 --> 02:20:08.660
I use a water testing
service and I test it both

02:20:08.660 --> 02:20:12.830
after it's through my water
filter and the tap water

02:20:12.830 --> 02:20:15.890
that my two boys drink
almost every day.

02:20:15.890 --> 02:20:17.120
And it's very interesting.

02:20:17.120 --> 02:20:19.700
I only found one
microplastic just a bit

02:20:19.700 --> 02:20:23.420
